Third-party code
----------------

Nova's directory layout and file names follow FreeBSD and NetBSD. The
names of constants and the format of interface data (the loader(8) boot
protocol, the syscall ABI) are FreeBSD's, so that Nova is compatible with
it.

If any code from FreeBSD or NetBSD (BSD licenses) is adapted into Nova,
the corresponding file MUST keep the original copyright notice and BSD
license in addition to the MPL-2.0 header.

